{"games":[{"id":18920893671,"name":"Mining Tycoon 💎 [Update 2!]","desc":"👍 Remember to like the game! A community code will be unlocked at 60,000 likes!\n[👍 50k Code] Mine50k\n[👍 40k Code] 40kThankYou\n[👍 30k Code] TyFor30k\n[👍 20k Code] Hooray20k\n\nManage your ore factory to purchase miners, build up your tower, and unlock better and more valuable tiers!\n\n⛏️ Build a massive tower of miners!\n🏭 Manage your factory and automate it as you get richer!\n🔓 Rebirth to unlock special perks, rebirth tokens, and more powerful ores!\n💾 All progress automatically saves!\n\n⭐ Join the \"Bloxforge X Team CB\" group to unlock in-game rewards!","path":"/game/18920893671-mining-tycoon","slug":"18920893671-mining-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/361eb8b2ade48bf45b708f24ce54292b585edfea16f741bb688dd89f547c83a0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6f76fb65a0ec0c8f31c1bc1ff54164f7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":6228942,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-05T18:47:54.527Z","creator":{"name":"Bloxforge X Team CB","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9903808883,"name":"[CO-OP] Build a Market Tycoon","desc":"👍 NEW CODE Releasing at 50K LIKES! 👍 \r\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮\r\n\r\nWelcome to Build a Market! Manage your own market by growing fresh plants, keeping your animals fed and happy, selling to customers, and hiring employees to expand your store! Unlock new items to sell and continue to build your market!\r\n\r\n🛒  Build the Biggest Market!\r\n🌻  Grow Crops and Tend to Animals!\r\n💸  Collect the Most Money to Hire Workers!\r\n👥  Visit your Friend's Markets!\r\n🏬  Expand your Market Corporation!\r\n\r\n⚒️ Updates Every Week! Lastest Update ⚒️\r\n - Thief event!\r\n- Overflowing bin market event!\r\n- Goat mount for market 2 completion!\r\nInspired by My Mini Mart mobile game\r\n\r\nTags: Mini, Shelf, Stacking, Job, Tycoon, Supermarket, Market, Store, Voldex","path":"/game/990